OL,3,GNEWSALeaseholder bills for major works 
OL,4,Ato average #15k                        
OL,6,FLeaseholders facing huge refurbishment 
OL,7,Fbills will be asked to pay an average  
OL,8,Fof #15,000 each, about half of their   
OL,9,Foriginal quote.                        
OL,11,FWoking Borough Council has reduced the 
OL,12,Fcombined repair cost to leaseholders in
OL,13,F14 medium-rise blocks in the Lakeview  
OL,14,Festate in Horsell from #2.6m to #1.3m. 
OL,16,FThe council removed combustible        
OL,17,Fcladding at the estate in 2024, leaving
OL,18,Fhomes covered with temporary sheets to 
OL,19,Fhelp keep out the water.               
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
